---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config';

const description =
  'Intelligence Adjacent is an anonymous explainer channel. Primary sources, practical steps, public corrections, and disclosed AI assistance.';
---

<Base title="About" description={description}>
  <p class="kicker">The channel</p>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose narrow">
    <p>
      Intelligence Adjacent explains security, AI, and other technology news without the product pitch.
      The person who makes it has spent years on incidents and is tired of hype. You do not get their
      name, face, location, or employer. The notes have to stand on the sources.
    </p>
    <h2>What an episode is</h2>
    <p>
      A video, and a page that goes further than the video. What happened. Whether it matters to you.
      The steps to protect yourself. Extra tips and instructions that did not fit on screen. Every source,
      and what it was used for.
    </p>
    <h2>How the work is done</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Primary sources first: vendor advisories, NVD, CISA, commit history, and the researcher's own write-up when there is one.</li>
      <li>Show the work. If a number is on the page, the source for that number is on the page.</li>
      <li>Other people's blogs and detection rules are labeled as research and inspiration, not as the record.</li>
      <li>Unconfirmed stays unconfirmed.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>
      If a claim is wrong, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or open an issue in this
      repository. The fix is logged on the episode and on the <a href="/corrections/">corrections</a> page.
      The old wording does not get quietly swapped out.
    </p>
    <h2>AI assistance</h2>
    <p>
      AI helps find sources, line up timelines, and check claims against the primary records. A human
      reviews every claim, every link, and every recommendation before publication. Companion videos may
      use a synthetic narration voice and, when they do, are labeled as altered or synthetic content on YouTube.
    </p>
    <p>It is a channel and the notes that go with the videos. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
